flowchart LR
    T[Test] --> S[Sequence]
    S -->|transaction object| Q[Sequencer]
    Q -->|transaction object| D[Driver]
    D -->|virtual interface handle| IF[Interface instance]
    IF -->|reset / enable / clk| DUT[Counter16 DUT]
    DUT -->|count| IF
    IF -->|virtual interface handle| M[Monitor]
    M -->|observed transaction| SB[Scoreboard]
    SB --> R[PASS / FAIL]
